# Keep this RELATIVE. It works unchanged in every environment:
#
#   local   — the Vite dev server proxies /api -> http://localhost:5050
#             (see vite.config.js), and ngrok tunnels work for free
#   Render  — the static site rewrites /api -> the API service (see render.yaml)
#
# In both cases the browser talks to one origin, so there is no CORS to
# configure and no deployed API URL baked into the build. Only set an absolute
# URL here if you deliberately want the app to call an API on another host.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
